# Yuanpeng Zhang’s Basilisk sandbox

This sandbox provides minimal reproducible test cases for my improved phase-field model
for ice--water phase-change problems.

## Talks and presentations

- [BGUM 2025: Simulation of melting/icing problems with the phase-field method](https://basilisk.fr/BGUM2025)  [(Slides) ](https://basilisk.fr/BGUM2025/zhang.pdf)

